OL,3,GNEWSABonfire Night violence condemned
OL,4,Aas six arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of officers were injured and
OL,7,Ffive police cars and three fire engines
OL,8,Fwere damaged, with the disorder linked
OL,9,Fto misinformation that a building would
OL,10,Fbe a house of multiple occupation (HMO)
OL,11,Ffor asylum seekers, the force said.
OL,13,FTyne and Wear Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,Farea manager Phil Clark said: "I've
OL,15,Fworked here for 33 years, it's the
OL,16,Fworst that I have seen."
